{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gunnery_yard","model_identifier":"gunnery_yard","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gunnery_yard\n\nGunnery yard: a stone-walled yard with an earth bank at the far end, wooden targets in front of it, and a cannon on a plank firing platform.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -108..108, y 0..51, z -110..108 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 93, construction_0 32, construction_33 37, construction_66 35, ruined 103 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- yard wall ring: 216 x 46 x 216, 8 u thick, open inside\n- earth bank: 200 x 50 x 40 at z 80\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `gunnery_yard_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `gunnery_yard_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_gunnery_yard` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -116)\n- `slot_cannon` at (0, 6, -50)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"swall_n1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-108.0,0.0,-108.0],"to":[-20.0,40.0,-100.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[400.0,226.0,488.0,266.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[48.0,266.0,56.0,306.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[400.0,226.0,488.0,266.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[48.0,266.0,56.0,306.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[216.0,362.0,304.0,370.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[216.0,362.0,304.0,370.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d681d539-1b18-54e0-8672-bf1b74b1bcab"},{"name":"swall_n2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[20.0,0.0,-108.0],"to":[108.0,40.0,-100.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[400.0,226.0,488.0,266.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[48.0,266.0,56.0,306.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[400.0,226.0,488.0,266.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[48.0,266.0,56.0,306.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[216.0,362.0,304.0,370.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[216.0,362.0,304.0,370.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"91f299b1-630a-5461-8455-734ac592d971"},{"name":"swall_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-108.0,0.0,100.0],"to":[108.0,40.0,108.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[216.0,0.0,432.0,40.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[56.0,266.0,64.0,306.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[216.0,0.0,432.0,40.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[56.0,266.0,64.0,306.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,362.0,216.0,370.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,362.0,216.0,370.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"06414e70-eea3-52b3-8b72-3a95018c8b2f"},{"name":"swall_